# Build-time frontend env vars for the Substrait deploy.
#
# Vite inlines import.meta.env.VITE_* into the bundle at BUILD TIME. This app needs
# none: it calls the API same-origin via relative /api paths, and the app title comes
# from the backend's /api/config at runtime (set APP_TITLE in backend/.env.example).
#
# ⚠️ PUBLIC, NON-SECRET VALUES ONLY if you add any — this file is committed to git
#    and baked into the JS bundle every visitor downloads.
# ⚠️ Do NOT set VITE_API_URL here: the platform forces it to "" during the build.